    <description>REV-60 Layer 1 — calls the ALM Promo/Dispatch engine for this quote's lines (invoked from Quote_AfterSave_MasterFlow after REV-71's stamp) and surfaces the SAVE-TIME BACKSTOP signal (out_hasGap / out_gapMessage) to the record-triggered master flow, which raises the Custom Error (Custom Error elements aren't allowed in autolaunched flows). A gap = an in-scope ALM line still missing a required Promo/Dispatch code AFTER the engine filled everything it could; because the engine auto-fills, promo never blocks and only a rep-required dispatch (Law.com/LWKM/NYOM) can trip it. Kill switches, the additive guard and fault logging live in the engine (ALMPromoDispatchEngine); it is inert (out_hasGap stays false) until ALM_Code_Engine_Settings.Control switches are on.</description>
